Validating terraform.io sub parameters using wildcard
Used of StringEquals with wildcard will fail, rather use StringLike. Testing StringLike on trust policy.

TakeAways:
1. Role and OIDC provider are in same account

2. aud matches exactly

3. sub is copied EXACTLY

4. Use StringLike for run_phase
"StringLike": {
  "app.terraform.io:sub": "organization:Enterpriseair-Cloud:workspace:awsInfraGovernance:run_phase:*"
}

5. Never hardcode only apply